WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
If your prep is ClenPIQ, this video will walk you through exactly how to take

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:03.680
it.

3
00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:05.280
Just follow along step by step.

4
00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:09.400
Your ClenPIQ prep comes as two small, ready to drink bottles.

5
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.400
You'll drink each bottle straight.

6
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:16.120
The day before your colonoscopy between five and nine PM, you'll drink your

7
00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:16.360
first

8
00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:17.880
bottle of ClenPIQ right from the bottle.

9
00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:21.680
After you finish it, drink five cups of clear liquid over the next three to

10
00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:22.280
five hours.

11
00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:25.160
Remember, no red, orange, blue or purple liquids.

12
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:30.400
For your second dose, six hours before your procedure time, drink your second

13
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:30.720
bottle

14
00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:31.440
of ClenPIQ.

15
00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:35.760
After finishing it, drink eight ounces of clear liquid every 15 minutes.

16
00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:38.720
This totals 32 ounces over one hour.

17
00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:43.120
If your procedure is scheduled for early morning, you will need to get up

18
00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:43.400
during

19
00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.080
the night to take the second dose.

20
00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:49.280
The correct timing of this dose is essential to an effective preparation.

21
00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:52.720
Do not have any liquids at all within four hours of your procedure.

22
00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:54.920
This part is really important.

23
00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:58.200
You must drink all of the prep solution as directed, even if you're already

24
00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.280
passing clear liquid.

25
00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:03.280
I know it can feel like enough, but finishing the entire dose is what gives us

26
00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:05.040
the clearest view during your procedure.

27
00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:07.840
If the prep isn't completed as directed,

28
00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:10.560
We may need to reschedule and neither of us wants that.

29
00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:13.720
Drink as many clear liquids as possible throughout the process.

30
00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:16.440
Hydration is important and it's actually part of the prep.

31
00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:19.880
Make sure to hydrate before you take the prep while you're taking the prep,

32
00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:21.680
but nothing after your second dose.

33
00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:25.840
If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom,

34
00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:30.120
applying a petroleum-based ointment or diaper rash cream can really help.

35
00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:31.320
That's it.

36
00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:32.000
You've got this.

37
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:35.720
Follow the timing, finish the full dose and stay hydrated.

38
00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:39.080
If you have any questions at all, don't hesitate to call our office.

39
00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:40.320
We're here to help.
